// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P567743781" "You found that the equipment stolen from Lockhart Aerotech was being used by Sky Raiders in West Libertalia."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P339087573" "The mysterious General Z was right; these records are most illuminating. It seems the Sky Raiders have been stealing tech from Lockhart for a long time. Then they've been using that technology in their mercenary campaign in West Libertalia. But from the records you found at Lockhart's warehouse, I'm not sure you interrupted a theft at all. More like a regular supply run. I'm going to have some people I know look into this."
// RandomFameString :
"P166904977" "Did you hear that the Lockhart Aerotech warehouse was broken into?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1819264588" "We got another message from the mysterious General Z. He says that you should talk to a senator named Gil Armand about his foreign policy work. He even knows where to find him, which is something the police may be interested in. Gil Armand was indicted just this morning for connections to the Sky Raiders. The police took most of his papers as evidence, but Armand himself disappeared. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could capture this fugitive politician, we could get two jobs done at once.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P985658772" "Capture the fugitive politician"
// SendOffString :
"P3320210393" "According to General Z, you'll be able to find Gil Armand in an unused section of the sewers. "
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4276478300" "Capture Armand and his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3226072126" "You've got to catch Gil Armand before the Council moves him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2325366066" "This old section of the sewers seems like the perfect hiding place for a traitor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3463006408" "Gil Armand"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3787026095" "Where is the extraction team?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P851581963" "You'll never take me alive!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1792231673" "You captured Gil Armand, the traitorous politician."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2550652701" "It looks like Senator Armand wasn't lying. The Sky Raiders hit the police van that was carrying all the evidence tying Armand to their organization. You got Armand himself, at least. That's one fewer villain out on the streets."
// RandomFameString :
"P1055053623" "Did you see Senator Armand on the news last night? I never knew he was dirty!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P761160580" "General Z just sent me the location of a Sky Raider base we should be interested in. According to Z, this base is where the Sky Raiders are keeping the evidence that links Senator Gil Armand to their organization. The police sure would like to see that evidence returned. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Of course, you'll have to go through the Sky Raiders to get it back.</a> Can you do it?"
// AcceptString :
"P2153184696" "Get the evidence back from the Sky Raiders"
// SendOffString :
"P2329268333" "I feel nervous sending you out on this one. General Z's tips have been good so far, but I still haven't been able to learn his identity."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2483431608" "Recover evidence from Sky Raiders"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P369720074" "Once you recover that evidence from the Sky Raiders, we may be able to put this all together."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3333195205" "You know that this is going to be dangerous, but the only way you're going to reach the truth is by fighting through the Sky Raiders to get there."

