// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4136169606" "I can't believe this government document. It's incendiary! It proposes using the Sky Raiders as mercenaries for illegal government operations. And it squarely states that Colonel Duray and the missing members of Vigilance didn't die, but went rogue. This could destroy the careers of numerous people in the military and intelligence community. I'll make sure that everything gets back to the police, and that copies of this paper get to the right people. This General Z isn't playing games."
// RandomFameString :
"P1454745849" "Word on the street is that {HeroName} is onto some big conspiracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P685753346" "{HeroName} really showed the Sky Raiders that they don't run this town."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3764976065" "General Z's tips have led us to some remarkable conclusions, and I think we need to follow up on them. In particular, I'd like to know more about the connection between Lockhart Aerotech and the Sky Raiders. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you head over to the Lockhart office and ask around?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3534986785" "Head to the Lockhart Aerotech office"
// SendOffString :
"P4177721391" "I'd sure like to know why Tyrone Lockhart is advocating government use of mercenaries. The same mercenaries who are supposed to be stealing from his company, no less!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1239916061" "Seek evidence at Lockhart"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2945973807" "Do you have the situation at Lockhart Aerotech in hand?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2367298140" "It's no visual clue that tips you off to the Sky Raiders' presence. It's the subtle whiff of gun polish."

