// Dialog :
"P105255824" "You've wrapped this one up nicely. But one thing still bothers me. That lab with the new Sky Raider gear. They were reverse engineering technology that looked like it belonged to Nemesis. Yes, Nemesis. The arch-villain who tried to take over the United States during the 1940's. No one's heard from him in 60 years, but that technology looked brand new. Puzzling, {HeroName}, puzzling. Maybe we'll learn more about this one day."
// RandomFameString :
"P4149342283" "I can't wait to read General Aaron's memoir. I hear he talks a lot about {HeroName}."
